WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.262
On T57, every member is verified before they trade.

2
00:00:05.462 --> 00:00:11.342
We check the business, its owners, its documents, sanctions lists, and we visit the site.

3
00:00:11.542 --> 00:00:15.134
A fake company fails. A real one is verified.

4
00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:18.506
Their trade score grows with every completed trade.

5
00:00:18.706 --> 00:00:21.684
So you only ever trade with verified members.

6
00:00:21.884 --> 00:00:24.548
T57. Apply for membership.
